,"created_at":"2026-10-15T15:01:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110747996266615283"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/BrmS47ehEn","end":295,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2110747996266615283/video/1","media_key":"7_2110747921704435712","start":272,"url":"https://t.co/BrmS47ehEn"}]},"id":"2110747996266615283","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":24,"impression_count":19966,"like_count":65,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":4},"text":"China’s frontier models already run on China’s own chips.\n\n“Remember, the GLM-5 paper is almost a year old at this point. They say: ‘From the first day, GLM-5 is full-stack adapted to Chinese GPU ecosystems. We have successfully completed deep optimization, spanning from https://t.co/BrmS47ehEn","url":"https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2110747996266615283"},{"author_id":"4398626122","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:35:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110741355739963884"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/SimonsFdn/stat…","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/SimonsFdn/status/2110740786169979088","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/VLVfCujFYu"}]},"id":"2110741355739963884","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":535,"impression_count":407319,"like_count":3972,"quote_count":162,"reply_count":404,"retweet_count":318},"text":"We want to support the mathematics community in turning progress in AI into deeper human understanding and new discoveries. To support that goal, we are contributing $5 million to a new Simons Foundation initiative to help mathematicians examine, understand, and build on results https://t.co/VLVfCujFYu","url":"https://x.com/OpenAI/status/2110741355739963884"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110721511288184832"]},"author_id":"12497","created_at":"2026-10-15T13:16:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110721515130089787"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"AI start-up gathered investors for presentations in San Francisco on Wednesday ahead of its anticipated pub