ases in the near future. Rumors include thinky, muse spark, and Chinese players who haven’t dropped in a while. Fable 5.5 and whatever OpenAI is cooking expected too at any moment.","url":"https://x.com/natolambert/status/2110700367147090339"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110693855117119488"]},"author_id":"1529761561170124800","created_at":"2026-10-15T11:26:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110693857742717372"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/PvZvD4KyvI","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2110693857742717372/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110693855117119488","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/PvZvD4KyvI"}]},"id":"2110693857742717372","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":50,"impression_count":28260,"like_count":505,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":47},"text":"Gemini 4 Argon scores 165 on the Epoch Capabilities Index (ECI), on par with Fable 5.1 (165) but behind Opus 5.5 (167) and GPT-6 Astra (166).\n\nWhile behind the ECI frontier, Argon is the closest Google’s come since Gemini 3.1 Pro in Feb, and a big jump from Gemini 3.8 Flash (157) https://t.co/PvZvD4KyvI","url":"https://x.com/EpochAIResearch/status/2110693857742717372"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110651017570488320"]},"author_id":"2465283662","created_at":"2026-10-15T08:36:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110651055331770485"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Join the discussion on this paper page","display_url":"huggingface.co/papers/2610.20…","end":84,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2610.20584","images":[{"height":648,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110572748770775040/kp6BvumS?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110572748770775040/kp6BvumS?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":61,"status":200,"title":"Paper page - Player-1: Learning to Play from Synthetic Experience","unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/papers/2610.20584","url":"https://t.co/qGBODdcfqW"},{"d